  "details": "# Issue: \n\nHaving the Friends Wing sorted by Location while switching through different Favorite Friends Lists or just opening the Wing it self will break the layout of the Friends Location Category in the Main Menu Social Tab. It looks like the Favorite List you choose to filter by has an affect on who gets shown in the Friends Location Category of the Main Menu.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Open Main Menu Social Tab and go to the Friends Location Category\n\n2. Open the Friends Wing\n\n3. Set the Friends Wing to be sorted by Location\n\n4. Now switch between your different Favorite Lists via the arrow buttons at the top\n\nIf you do this you will notice the layout of the Friends Locations Category in the Main Menu breaking.  \n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe Filter of the Friends Wing should have no impact on which Friends get shown in the Friends Location Category in the Social Tab of the Main Menu.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/dr2971.mp4",
